Package: sqlDT
Title: Display a DataTable from a SQL Query with Crosstalk Support
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Li", email = "temp@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: sqlDT is an HTMLwidget which works with Crosstalk to execute a SQL query 
  on a single input table, and output that using DataTables. This table updates when 
  the crosstalk brushing or filtering is applied.
URL: https://github.com/pli9/sqlDT, https://pli9.github.io/sqlDT/
BugReports: https://github.com/pli9/sqlDT/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
